<title>USA: Union Property seeks merger partner.</title>
<headline>Union Property seeks merger partner.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla. 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Property Investors Inc said on Friday that it is currently negotiating for the merger of the company into a publicly traded real estate investment trust.</p>
<p>The company previously announced it had retained Societe Generale to explore the possibility of the company electing real estate investment trust status or merging with, or selling its assets to, a real estate investment trust.</p>
</text>
